UPDATE workers SET description='Alexander Novak is an official referee for LAT, one of the most trusted officials in Luxembourg wrestling. Known for strict rule enforcement and quick three-counts, Alexander Novak has officiated some of the biggest matches in LAT history. With a keen eye for interference and a no-nonsense approach to disqualifications, Alexander Novak keeps the matches fair — or at least tries to, when managers and heels don''t get in the way. A good referee is invisible when the match is going well and decisive when it isn''t, and Alexander Novak embodies that philosophy every time they step into the ring.' WHERE workerID=9483;
UPDATE workers SET description='Marco Horvat is a veteran manager in LAT, a ringside manipulator whose interference and mind games have cost countless opponents their matches. With decades of experience in Luxembourg wrestling, Marco Horvat knows every trick in the book — the distraction, the foreign object, the timely trip — and uses them all to give their clients the advantage. While not a wrestler themselves, Marco Horvat understands the psychology of the business better than most in-ring performers, and their stable of managed talent is always a threat to any champion.' WHERE workerID=9484;
