UPDATE workers SET description='Arjun Singh is a veteran manager in MAL, a ringside manipulator whose interference and mind games have cost countless opponents their matches. With decades of experience in Maldives wrestling, Arjun Singh knows every trick in the book — the distraction, the foreign object, the timely trip — and uses them all to give their clients the advantage. While not a wrestler themselves, Arjun Singh understands the psychology of the business better than most in-ring performers, and their stable of managed talent is always a threat to any champion.' WHERE workerID=10236;
