UPDATE workers SET description='Liang Wu is a veteran manager in VIE, a ringside manipulator whose interference and mind games have cost countless opponents their matches. With decades of experience in Vietnam wrestling, Liang Wu knows every trick in the book — the distraction, the foreign object, the timely trip — and uses them all to give their clients the advantage. While not a wrestler themselves, Liang Wu understands the psychology of the business better than most in-ring performers, and their stable of managed talent is always a threat to any champion.' WHERE workerID=10676;
